---
mori::check::wrong_asset_domain

  × The asset `GOLD` is on `Other`, but this obligation is on `Preview`.
   ╭─[test.mori:7:59]
 6 │   asset GOLD = { domain: Other, id: "gold", scale: 3, representation: "native" };
 7 │   obligation loan = { domain: Preview, id: "loan", asset: GOLD };
   ·                                                           ──┬─
   ·                                                             ╰── on `Other`
 8 │   share_class shares = { domain: Preview, id: "shares", backing: GOLD };
   ╰────
  help: An asset used by a declaration must be on the same domain.

